<title>UK: GSI sets warrants on Holderbank.</title>
<headline>GSI sets warrants on Holderbank.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued 2.5 million American-style call warrants, on Holderbank bearer shares, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Bank said.</p>
<p>Twenty warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    930 CHF		   PREMIUM	11.53 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     4.30 CHF		  GEARING	10.59 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 27.NOV.96-19.JUN.98   PAYDATE	26.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  911 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
